WEBVTT

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.470
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:12.740
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.540
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:22.020
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.760
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.430
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:36.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:45.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:56.430
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.630
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:04.290
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:11.440
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:20.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:42.970
DEMON MINIYON
THE DEVIL'S PENDANT

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.510
Good morning!

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:54.950
- Good morning!

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:57.040
Good morning, Yamada!

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:58.320
Yo!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.020
Good morning!

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.190
Hey!

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:07.660
Good morning!

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.760
Here she comes...

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:11.530
Good morning!

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:14.360
I said, "good morning"!

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.240
Good morning!

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.310
C'mon! Good morning!

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.210
So annoying...

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:27.650
Just say something!
Good morning!

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.750
He's too shy to look at me!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.250
You're too cute, little Devilman!

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:41.260
Who was that girl?

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.430
No idea.

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.860
She looks like that ditz we
met a while back at the lodge.

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.400
It's just your imagination.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.930
NAKADO ACADEMY

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:53.870
Zoo.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:58.010
Not as in "zou," but as in a
place where they keep animals.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.070
Ahem. Do you understand?

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:04.350
Specifically, I mean the London Zoo.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:07.920
By the way, have you seen
the panda at Ueno Zoo?

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.250
- This is boring.

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:11.350
- I've seen him. He's a lovely creature.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:13.230
- This is so lame!

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:19.960
You little!

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:23.410
Hey you! What's the big deal?

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.540
Oh no!

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:44.660
Go now, Miniyon, and demonstrate
your power to the humans!

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:51.570
As you wish!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:58.870
I shall go to the human world at
once and kill that detestable Devilman!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.700
Miniyon, that won't be necessary.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.810
You little fool! Who said anything
about killing Devilman?

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:07.940
What?

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:12.080
Humans are your only concern.
Spread your magic amongst them!

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.980
Okay, I see!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:18.620
That is a simple matter.
I shall be on my way, then.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.260
Sorry!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:28.970
He has rare magic powers, but his
hastiness is like a flaw in a jewel.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.650
Darling, come here a minute.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:52.060
Look! What's that shiny
thing over there?

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:55.690
This?

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.090
It's a brooch.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:00.430
Maybe Ms. Em (rum
upstairs dropped it.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:04.100
Oh well. Let's turn it
in to the superintendent.

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:05.240
I say we keep it.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.500
But...

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.170
Oh, come on!

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:14.110
She drops clusters, underwear,
diapers, everything! It's a real pain!

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:16.340
That's something else entirely!

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:20.710
The other day, she threw down a
flower pot! It nearly killed me!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.620
All right, but...

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:23.950
I said we're keeping it!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:25.690
Fine, fine! I get it!

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:27.630
Who cares about this cheap thing?

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.930
The brooch is getting bigger!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.630
I didn't mean to!

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.160
I told you we were feeding
Mike too much!

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.870
Wait for me!

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.770
Help!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.780
These humans are so petty.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:26.450
They only settle down
when I shrink them.

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:41.240
Huh?

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.810
Hey, that's pretty!

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.480
Right? Right?

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.780
I'll take this home to the wife!

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:00.160
Unless there are any objections.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:10.590
Hey you! You're letting someone
steal right in front of you!

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:15.590
What if I were murdering someone?
Would you ignore that, too?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.370
Well?
Hey!

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.400
Oh, what a shame...

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.040
Enervation, apathy, irresponsibility...

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.980
Are you proud of yourself, Japan?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.750
Are you proud of that?!
Are you proud of that?!

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:42.790
I know I'm drunk,
but this car sure got big!

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.640
MEN'S WEEKLY ISSUE 17

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:50.940
H-Help me!

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.950
Hey, wait! Stop the train! Hey!

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:03.790
TOKYO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.550
What's going on?

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:10.900
Someone help!

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:21.530
It's coming after us!

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:31.540
Thank you for your business.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.380
He forgot this!

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.650
I'm sure he'll come back for
something this important.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.120
What a pretty brooch!

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:51.630
G-Grandma! Grandma!
We're in trouble!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.610
What is it? My eyes are
giving me trouble...

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.330
Akira, where are you going?

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.870
To buy some cigarettes.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.670
I'm telling!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.840
They're not for me!
They're for your papa!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.950
I'll come along too!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.820
You just want to come along
to see Miyo, don't you?

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:17.890
Hi!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.420
You again?

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:23.290
- You're so shy!
- Who is?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.290
You need not be so shy, Devilman-

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.460
You little...

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.160
Ouch! Ouch!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.600
Please be more gentle
when you hold my hand!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:32.930
You damn fool!

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:34.140
You go on ahead.

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.920
- Who's she?
- It doesn't matter!

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:41.480
Akira has some weird friends.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:44.750
Huh? No one's here.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:47.510
Hello?
Are you home, Miyo?

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.720
Help!

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.830
Wh-Where are you Miyo?

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:56.390
I'm here! Here!

00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:01.100
Right here! A dog is eating me!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:04.060
Help me, Tare!

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:05.840
Hey, wait you!

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:09.540
- Wait!
- Help me!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.380
Hold it!
Give me back my Miyo!

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:16.410
I said give her back!

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.590
Give Miyo back!

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.820
- This has gone on long enough.
- It certainly has!

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:32.930
Please be honest,
little Devilman!

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:34.830
What'd you say?!

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:37.930
Please tell me honestly
that you love me!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.840
Miki and I are as different
as night and day!

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:43.870
Aren't I bewitching?

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.770
You little...

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:50.010
My, I'm so happy! You're so impressed
with me, you can't even speak!

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:52.780
I can't take this anymore!

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:56.750
DEVIL!

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.190
Damn...

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:08.510
That's right, you should look your
best when you propose to me!

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:11.840
Do I have to hurt you?!

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:15.370
Goodness!
You're such a kidder!

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:16.850
That's it!

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:22.910
I already know how manly you are.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:23.820
Huh?

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:30.150
You're fighting with Devilman?
Lala, fight!

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:32.600
I shall assist you!

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:34.990
Devilman, look out!

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:36.200
What?

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.660
- Devilman!
- Is that Miniyon?

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.200
Damn!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.000
Where is he?

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:53.350
No, Devilman!

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:55.890
What's the meaning of this,
Miniyon!?

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:01.210
Calm down!
I did not mean to intrude.

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:04.320
I'm leaving, so you're free to finish him!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.590
Honestly! Miniyon,
you little shrimp!

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:10.590
Devilman! Devilman!

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:17.230
Thank you, Devilman! You threw
me aside so I would be safe!

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:20.670
Your head is full of love for me.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:23.840
I'm so moved by your feelings!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.680
I'll call a doctor.

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:28.040
This is bad!

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.850
Heh, she's so stupid.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:32.750
You big fool!

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:38.820
She's really a fool...

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:43.090
A human doctor can't cure me!
Plus, my cover will be blown!

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.760
That fool!

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.940
T-Tare! Help me!

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:03.250
You jerk! You jerk!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.390
Meanie!

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:09.420
Ouch! Ouch!

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:12.160
Ow! Ouchie! Ow!

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:15.430
Take this!

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:28.540
Hang in there, Tare!

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:30.540
I'm done for!

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.990
- Tare! You're a man, aren't you?
- I am a man!

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:36.540
Miyo!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.420
It's really you, Miyo!

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:40.150
Tare...

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.750
Now I can't marry you!

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:49.460
Please don't be sad!
How did you get small?

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.890
I don't know!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.870
Oh wait, that's right.
It was a weird brooch.

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:57.260
A brooch?

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.270
Yeah, it was shiny.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.730
A shiny one?

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:05.610
Grandma picked it up,
and then we shrank.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.140
What's wrong, Tare?

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.740
No, don't do it!

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:15.320
If you touch it, you'll shrink like me!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.850
- That's okay!
- Huh?

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:20.900
I'll be small like you!

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.890
Tare, are you nuts?

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:28.660
If you're small, then
I'll be small, too!

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.730
That'll make us equal!
You see, Miyo?

00:14:31.270 --> 00:14:33.010
T-Tare!

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:39.420
Watch out!
That's Miniyon!

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:46.420
What do you think you're doing?

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:50.220
Shut up! How dare you
torture my boyfriend?

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:54.490
Boyfriend? Who would
love an idiot like you?

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:58.160
How dare you,
you shrimpy little beast!

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:00.670
Take this!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.910
I was being merciful
since you're so stupid!

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:14.420
Catch me if you can!
Just try to shrink me!

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:19.510
That is not my only power! Behold!

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:28.050
Fire safety! Oh no!

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:32.260
It's so hot!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.070
Help me!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.610
Hot!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.810
Well, how about this?

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:54.790
Attack from above! No!

00:15:57.250 --> 00:15:59.250
What about that?

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:05.330
He ran away!

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:08.370
No! What are you doing?

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:14.070
Help! I'm afraid of heights!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:18.380
Devilman, help! Devilman!

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.510
What?

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.860
Do something!

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:33.760
Damn you, Miniyon!

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:40.970
Help! I can't swim!

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:47.800
You useless girl!
I shall shrink you, too!

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:51.150
Then a snake will eat you!

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.180
Lala!

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:57.950
DEVIL!

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:09.930
I wonder if my measurements
will change when I shrink?

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:13.300
Devilman!

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:15.230
What?!

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:17.860
- Miniyon!
- Do not get excited, Devilman!

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.730
No matter how deadly you are,

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:22.770
you are still only 40 cm
tall! A mini-Devilman!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.840
Your powers will not work!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:27.410
Damn!

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:34.810
Devil Wing!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.090
You little--

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:41.020
You're wonderful Devilman!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.500
And now...

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:50.900
What is this?

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:53.470
I'm sorry!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.000
You're going to pull my head off!

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.010
Almost...

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:04.720
This is nothing!

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:19.140
Miss!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.660
Are you okay, miss?

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.140
I'm okay!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:31.340
One second,
I just need to fix my make up!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:40.220
Well, Devilman? If you let
go, you will be barbecued!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.220
Damn!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.730
Devil Beam!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.900
I expected no less from Devilman!
I'm sorry!

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:01.440
Tare!

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:04.880
Miyo!

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:07.540
Tare!

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:10.480
You're back to normal!

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:12.380
I'm sorry for making you worry!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.110
It's fine, Miyo.
I'm so happy!

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:17.430
Miyo!

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.030
How touching!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:34.940
That does it, Devilman! And to
think Lala has become your ally!

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:41.550
Remember! The curse of the Demon
Marshal will tear you to pieces!

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:44.550
- Good morning!
- Good morning!

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:50.750
Good morning!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.990
Hey, good morning!

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:54.360
Again?

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:58.620
- Good morning, Miss Lala!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.870
Good morning!

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.860
When did you two become friends?

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:05.430
It's a secret!

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:13.580
Well, time to go to human
school! Hand in hand...

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:21.390
No! Stupid!
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:24.360
How the hell am I
gonna keep this up?

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:49.910
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:56.610
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:04.270
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:10.110
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:14.030
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:17.240
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:22.240
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:33.120
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:53.150
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:59.350
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:04.850
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:11.950
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:16.730
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.730
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:26.410
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:36.550
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:03.640
Demon Kenetos drops his
feathers onto Earth.

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:07.490
A mysterious present arrives
in the human world.

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:15.720
They are terrifying necklaces
that take people's heads

00:23:16.020 --> 00:23:17.760
and transport them to another dimension.

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:24.970
Yoshiko, what happened?!

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:31.900
What's that?

00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:33.650
A monster!

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:39.750
Why am I just a head?

00:23:39.750 --> 00:23:42.750
Where's my body?

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:45.250
Where am I?

00:23:45.250 --> 00:23:47.220
Mister, Look out!

00:23:47.220 --> 00:23:52.220
Alphonne's body, having lost its head,
is now aimlessly wandering the city.

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:58.840
The severed heads in the other
dimension approach execution
at the hand of Kenetoss.

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:11.080
Well, I...

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:16.080
All of Earth's humans will live here
in Kenetos' world of darkness!

00:24:17.520 --> 00:24:22.730
Those who fail to serve
Kenetos will be torn to shreds!

00:24:23.760 --> 00:24:29.260
Devilman enters the other dimension,
but Kenetos is after his blood!

00:24:32.870 --> 00:24:34.200
Let's go, Devilman!

00:24:34.200 --> 00:24:35.540
Come, Kenetos!

00:24:36.000 --> 00:24:37.540
Die!

00:24:45.450 --> 00:24:46.850
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:46.850 --> 00:24:50.920
DEMON KENETOS
THE MYSTERIOUS NECKLACE
